## Usage Examples

### Interactive Mode
```bash
./mysh
$> pwd
/tmp
$> cd test
$> pwd
/tmp/test
$> exit
```

### Non-Interactive Mode
```bash
echo "ls -l" | ./mysh
echo "pwd" | ./mysh
```

### Built-in Usage
```bash
$> setenv MYVAR myvalue
$> env | grep MYVAR
MYVAR=myvalue
$> unsetenv MYVAR
```

